ress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b55b064908859e68698015181edbc2b2, https://si.imgix.net/f0633e73/uploads/origins/c047949c-035e-4d3d-b479-1c13b28b9706?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45e8dcac407288374aaf9733f113a59e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f0633e73/uploads/origins/c047949c-035e-4d3d-b479-1c13b28b9706?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f5d68b8154c401ebded9e39e0f6159e1 3x"}, "body": "Hi! Can you consider drawing my friend’s vtuber?\n\nThis is the model reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1X8BVICO8FRofRQAJs71gprRexSXRWJl9/view?usp=sharing\n\nI would like her to be drawn in this similar position/outfit:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/16hr6v3LoyIyX_IQruJbrJw0r6NqHaiIe/view?usp=sharing\n\nThis is Xionfox. She's a Fox Idol who loves to sing and dance on stage! She has Fox ears and a tail as well as fang [pointed] canine teeth, her jacket is a black and white cropped jacket with orange accents [X's over the front and ribbons along the sides] She has a paw tag chocker which is beloved by her fans as well as bows in her hair and on her skirt. On the inside of her boots are orange paw prints as well. Thank you for taking th time to review my request!\n\nThe art will be used for merchandise, website, thumbnail, twitch and twitter.\nI will credit the artist whenever the art is used.\nIf background is drawn, please separate the it with the art. \nThank you.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@OCDDDK/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2467198, "client_id": 2403555, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bffe0ef2/uploads/origins/024259a5-bf32-4e73-a20f-c26ca0283333?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98a127418f34043524b1d7a7912b1901